{
  "_comment": [
    "Which spoken phrase each moment on the page lands on. `id` is a cue id: the slide id, a colon,",
    "then the cue name the page writes, so data-in=\"guess\" inside <template data-slide=\"1.2\"> is",
    "1.2:guess. `phrase` is a word or short phrase from that section of script.md, matched ignoring case",
    "and punctuation. `occurrence` picks which match, counting from 1, and every row here names it, so",
    "a phrase the script repeats later never moves a picture by accident.",
    "`1.5:long` and `1.5:short` are the two cues the slide lists in data-owns and a handler serves."
  ],
